        <body>
            <div xml:id="d395-a1">

                <pb facs="0445" n="1179" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1179"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 318.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum.</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The minister of state entertains the complaint of the Government of the United
                    States, with the desire to decide upon it with justice. As yet he has not
                    received official information of the incident complained of; but he has promised
                    me to demand it imperatively, and when he has received it he will
                    adopt—according to the principles of international law and without prejudice to
                    the authority which he has a right to exercise in the territorial waters of
                    Cuba—the proper measures, if any involuntary wrong has been committed against
                    the Government of the United States.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
